# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CMB Cargo — environment
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored.
# On Hostinger: hPanel → the Node.js web app → Environment Variables, then
# redeploy (or restart the app) so the running server picks them up.
# On Vercel: Settings → Environment Variables (add to Production + Preview).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── ENQUIRY FORM DELIVERY (required) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The contact form sends to enquiry@cmbcargo.ae over SMTP. Until these are set
# the endpoint returns 503 and the form tells visitors to phone or email
# instead — deliberately, so an enquiry is never silently dropped.
#
# cmbcargo.ae email is hosted on ZOHO INDIA — the domain's MX records are
# mx.zoho.in and its SPF record is "include:zohomail.in".
#
# ⚠️ That means the host below is smtp.zoho.IN, not smtp.zoho.com. Zoho keeps
# accounts on the data centre they were created in, and authenticating against
# the wrong region fails with "invalid credentials" even when the password is
# perfectly correct. This is the single most common way this setup goes wrong.
#
# SMTP_PASS must be an **app-specific password** generated in Zoho, not the
# normal mailbox password — Zoho rejects account passwords for SMTP whenever
# two-factor authentication is on. Generate one at:
#   Zoho Mail → My Account → Security → App Passwords
SMTP_HOST=smtp.zoho.in
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=enquiry@cmbcargo.ae
SMTP_PASS=

# Optional. Defaults to true when SMTP_PORT is 465, false otherwise.
# SMTP_SECURE=true

# Optional. Where enquiries land. Defaults to site.contact.salesEmail
# (enquiry@cmbcargo.ae). Comma-separate to copy more than one mailbox.
# ENQUIRY_TO=enquiry@cmbcargo.ae

# Optional. The From address. Defaults to SMTP_USER. It must be a mailbox the
# SMTP account is allowed to send as, or the host will reject the message.
# ENQUIRY_FROM=enquiry@cmbcargo.ae

# ── ALTERNATIVE: webhook instead of SMTP ─────────────────────────────────────
# A POST endpoint that receives the enquiry as JSON (CRM intake, Zapier, Make,
# Slack incoming webhook). Only used when SMTP is not configured.
# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=
